  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: infinite loop and memory exhaustion in Pod::Text\n     when the =over margin reaches the output width\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-82560.patch: when the margin equals or\n       exceeds the output width, report \"Margin is wider than the output\n       width\" and wrap as if the margin were zero in wrap() in\n       cpan/podlators/lib/Pod/Text.pm and its Color, Overstrike and\n       Termcap subclasses; backported from upstream podlators commit\n       70510174f69eb54aa6d617bde4e1402cd9b7c61f.\n     - CVE-2026-82560",
